Subject: [PATCH] arm64: configs: Enable STM32_I3C in
 fragment-02-defconfig-addons.config

Enable CONFIG_STM32_I3C in fragment-02-defconfig-addons.config.

Signed-off-by: Alain Volmat <alain.volmat@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: Idb44c377940b185d22b925d7ed618bd97a3764c8
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/545091
Domain-Review: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Tested-by: Alain VOLMAT <alain.volmat@st.com>
Reviewed-by: Alain VOLMAT <alain.volmat@st.com>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/fragment-02-defconfig-addons.config | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/arch/arm64/configs/fragment-02-defconfig-addons.config
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/fragment-02-defconfig-addons.config
@@ -77,6 +77,7 @@ CONFIG_STM32_ADC_CORE=m
 CONFIG_STM32_DBG_BUS=y
 CONFIG_STM32_DMA3=y
 CONFIG_STM32_FMC2_EBI=y
+CONFIG_STM32_I3C=m
 CONFIG_STM32_IPCC=y
 CONFIG_STM32_LPTIMER_CNT=m
 CONFIG_STM32_MDF_CORE=m
